### 提示
### 先执行 `requests/auth.http` 里的登录请求，
### 然后把返回的 `access-token` 和 `refresh-token` 放到下面的变量里。
###
### 所有用户信息接口统一使用 UserInfo 结构体响应：
### {
###   "user_id": 1,
###   "username": "takamatsu_tomori",
###   "email": "...",
###   "phone": "...",
###   "bio": "...",
###   "avatar": "...",
###   "admin": false,
###   "role": 0,
###   "post_count": N,
###   "comment_count": N
### }

@baseUrl = http://localhost:2333
@accessToken = your_access_token
@refreshToken = your_refresh_token

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 需要认证的接口
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### update password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/update_password
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "old_password": "114514",
  "new_password": "114514",
  "env": {
    "ipv6": "test",
    "device_info": "test",
    "os": "Windows"
  }
}

### update profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/update_profile
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "new_username": "takamatsu_tomori",
  "new_email": "alphazer01214@gmail.com",
  "new_avatar": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/1/1.png",
  "new_bio": "I'm takamatsu_tomori",
  "new_phone": "114514",
  "env": {
    "ipv6": "test",
    "device_info": "test",
    "os": "Windows"
  }
}

### current user (me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 公开接口
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### query one user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/1

### query all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/all_users

### query user's posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/1/posts?page=1&page_size=20

### query user's comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/1/comments?page=1&page_size=20
